# Generated by the app at runtime. Never commit these:
#  - they are reproducible from the source documents plus an API key
#  - extraction output contains whatever was in the documents, which for real
#    filings means names, addresses and other personal data
#  - page_images alone runs to several MB per folder
input_folders/*/parse_results/
input_folders/*/extract_results/
input_folders/*/regions/
input_folders/*/page_images/
input_folders/*/HIL_results/

# API key. Also ignored by the repo-root .gitignore; belt and braces.
.env
